# Licenses

Paperback itself is under the [MIT license](https://github.com/trypsynth/paperback/blob/master/LICENSE.md). It is built on a great deal of other people's work, and this page credits all of it.

Everything listed here is under a permissive license. Nothing Paperback ships places conditions on what you may do with it.

## Native libraries

These are not Rust crates. They are compiled libraries that ship alongside the application, so no tool can find them in the source tree and they are recorded here by hand.

